        "original_id": "b5021d74-72ca-555e-85df-179157bb0d19",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Characters: Alma Wade\n- Franchises: F.E.A.R.\n- Games: F.E.A.R. First Encounter Assault Recon, SAS: Secure Tomorrow\n- Companies: Monolith Productions, Sierra Entertainment\n- Systems: Jupiter EX engine\n- Genres: first-person shooter, survival horror\n\nFacts:\n- In 2005, Monolith Productions introduced Alma Wade in \"F.E.A.R.\" as a major antagonist and key figure in the \"F.E.A.R.\" series.\n- Alma Wade is the central mystery at the core of the \"F.E.A.R.\" series.\n- \"F.E.A.R. First Encounter Assault Recon\" is a survival horror first-person shooter video game developed by Monolith Productions and published by Sierra Entertainment.\n- \"SAS: Secure Tomorrow\" uses the Jupiter EX engine, which is similar or possibly identical to the engine used in \"F.E.A.R.\".",
